CALSCALE:GREGORIAN
METHOD:PUBLISH
X-WR-CALNAME:Gulf Coast Home Maintenance: Must Do + Going Above
X-WR-CALDESC:One calendar carrying Must Do and Going Above. Subscribe to th
 is instead of to each of them separately\, not as well\, or every shared e
 vent arrives twice. General maintenance guidance\, not a substitute for a 
 licensed inspector\, contractor\, or your insurance policy terms.
X-WR-TIMEZONE:America/Chicago
REFRESH-INTERVAL;VALUE=DURATION:P1D
X-PUBLISHED-TTL:P1D
COLOR:firebrick
